  "question": {
    "text": "If the domain of the function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>25</mn></msqrt><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>10</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>∞</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>∪</mo><mfenced open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>∞</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>β</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math> is equal to:"
