  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>25</mn></msqrt><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0043_bc617276405d.png\" style=\"width: 405px; height: 118px;\"/></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>∞</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>]</mo><mo>∪</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>∞</mo><mo>)</mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0043_989b12274aa2.png\" style=\"width: 404px; height: 115px;\"/></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mo>∞</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>∪</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>∞</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Using <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo> </mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo> </mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0043_32bfc9709818.png\" style=\"width: 409px; height: 133px;\"/></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mo>∞</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>∪</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>∞</mo><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>So, on comparing with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mo>∞</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>∪</mo><mo>[</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>∞</mo><mo>)</mo></math> we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>β</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>5</mn></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>β</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>150</mn></math></p>"
